Package: HSDPD
Type: Package
Title: Heterogeneous Spatio-Temporal Dynamic Panel Data Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Michele", "La Rocca", email = "larocca@unisa.it", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Maria Lucia", "Parrella", email = "mparrel@exaunisa.it", role = "aut"),
    person("Francesco", "Giordano", email = "giordano@unisa.it", role = "ctb"),
    person("Cira", "Perna", email = "perna@unisa.it", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Tools for building, simulating, estimating, testing, and plotting
    hierarchical spatial dynamic panel data models. The package provides
    utilities for constructing SDP-D model objects, reading spatio-temporal
    data from data frames or raster objects, fitting model parameters, running
    bootstrap-based tests, and producing diagnostic plots.
